    "description": "Hand-written field-level baseline derived from source reading at commit 815a082258ac9d087304db500bea1c1c7c388790. FOSRest 3 type:rest routing, JMS Serializer reflection of private entity properties, Bazinga Hateoas _links, Symfony Form request body wrapped in {data:...}, and the JTTP success/error envelope produced by app.view_handler and the kernel.exception listener. No PHP runtime was available in the audit environment; contracts are locked from source plus stable FOSRest/JMS/Symfony semantics."
